{"id":"n20246-1-13","stage":1,"title":"오전 · 上午","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20246-1-13-1","ko":"언제까지 일을 마쳐야 하나요?","zh":"我需要在什么时候之前完成工作？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지","audio":"/audio/8902d9621c6f3af4db86.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"마쳐야","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마쳐야","audio":"/audio/2b73ec03c6b3bcf403af.mp3"}},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2492382c9add1b28da1f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20246-1-13-2","ko":"아무리 늦어도 오늘 오전 안에는 마쳐야 합니다.","zh":"最晚今天上午之内必须完成。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무리","meaning":"多么","explanation":"아무리：多么。","readings":[{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71338","senseId":"2","lemma":"아무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}},{"text":"늦어도","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦어도","audio":"/audio/e61fbad18bf98d06f48f.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"오전","meaning":"上午","explanation":"오전：上午。","readings":[{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20246","senseId":"1","lemma":"오전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}},{"text":"안에는","meaning":"内，以内","explanation":"안：内，以内；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"2","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안에는","audio":"/audio/e263eeb86ca976ce2ed4.mp3"}},{"text":"마쳐야","me